 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AY-e-BhphJQQ7kNvwEM_yxP&_nc_oc=AdqRUgY0tKpR9VKYXMlruKT6sLJycOQl3vl-ZI0BzL4e0oKLjsuLiP6GNQgQUcG_FJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG2vLEzupmVHr6NqzLLLC0c2bFrsqvwLT9H8LOEY8Zmhw&oe=6A804B01"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=53H6vJ3aJq0Q7kNvwED-_Av&_nc_oc=Adrtqz9NqhrtQKAtoGBwJNUJn8q2i44sQk1HuHcQlOPlRF_HJz8OMtWMVZnPhw1mrfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHHK4nk6ZcTVon7KsZ09KlCzAr-8YcPXv9caHMTRlvI7A&oe=6A805866"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EDUlIqomlJoQ7kNvwETeEw9&_nc_oc=AdrejZNxU-VlWnC4rJUYXIDvuCsIw1I3VMsnuH6oCLen35K_YabuawScuqV7SKkzgb4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFgyegJt7iUn6u2Z9mSWgCK0k81gIaLlLdnvukc5p51Qg&oe=6A80625C"}, {"fil